<title>SPAIN: Bank of Spain sells peseta/mark - dealers.</title>
<headline>Bank of Spain sells peseta/mark - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain sold pesetas against marks at 84.08 per mark to brake the peseta's rise, dealers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Bank of Spain, as is its practice, declined to comment.</p>
<p>The peseta was drawing support from the strength of the U.S. dollar and the Italian lira, but still failed to break through the key 84.00 level.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
